                <div id="w-node-af35ed81-df63-fbca-8937-61fea94f6558-d28188ac" class="card-contaiiner">
                  <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-content-why_choose"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Obrizum-challenge-1.avif" alt="" class="img-why_choose">
                      <div class="gap-8 padding-0">
                        <h3 class="heading-24-120">Increase in video demand with a small internal team</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150-2 opacity-80">As Obrizum’s client base grew, they faced internal bottlenecks due to rising video production needs and a limited in-house team.</div>
                      </div>
