                <div id="w-node-af35ed81-df63-fbca-8937-61fea94f656a-d28188ac" class="card-contaiiner">
                  <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-content-why_choose"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Obrizum-challenge-2.avif" alt="" class="img-why_choose">
                      <div class="gap-8 padding-0">
                        <h3 class="heading-24-120">Unpredictable video needs</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150-2 opacity-80">Most of Obrizum’s videos were created for clients, with demand fluctuating month to month. Hiring a full creative team wasn’t ideal when workloads constantly shifted.</div>
                      </div>
