                      <div class="gap-8 padding-0">
                        <h3 class="heading-24-120">Too high of a cost</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150-2 opacity-80">With the volume and variety of videos required, working with traditional agencies would have been too costly for Obrizum.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
